1:["$","main",null,{"className":"reading-page post-reading-page","children":["$","article",null,{"className":"post-article h-entry","children":[["$","$L7",null,{"className":"u-url sr-only","href":"/blog/llm/guide-to-lr-warmup-cosine-annealing-gradient-clipping","children":["模型训练核心技巧：学习率预热、余弦衰减与梯度裁剪"," 永久链接"]}],["$","a",null,{"className":"p-author h-card sr-only","href":"https://github.com/hedon954","rel":"author","children":"Hedon"}],["$","figure",null,{"className":"article-hero article-cover","children":["$","img",null,{"className":"u-photo","src":"https://hedon.top/hedonspace/banner/guide-to-lr-warmup-cosine-annealing-gradient-clipping.jpg","alt":"模型训练核心技巧：学习率预热、余弦衰减与梯度裁剪 的文章封面"}]}],["$","header",null,{"className":"article-header article-summary-row","children":[["$","p",null,{"className":"eyebrow","children":"大模型"}],["$","h1",null,{"className":"p-name","children":"模型训练核心技巧：学习率预热、余弦衰减与梯度裁剪"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"article-deck p-summary","children":"本篇深入探讨了深度学习训练中的三大核心优化技巧，学习率预热解决训练初期不稳定性，余弦衰减实现精细调整和平滑收敛，梯度裁剪防止梯度爆炸。从原理到实践，全面解析如何让模型在高维损失空间中更稳定、更高效地找到最优解。"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"article-meta","children":[["$","time",null,{"className":"dt-published","dateTime":"2025-08-21T15:30:20.000Z","children":["发布于 ","2025/08/21"]}],"$undefined",["$","span",null,{"children":"$undefined"}],["$","span",null,{"children":["约 ","4,966"," 字"]}]]}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"article-reading-layout","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"article-reading-column","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"e-content","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"markdown-body","children":[["$","p","p-0",{"children":"本篇我们来深入探讨一下学习率预热（Learning Rate Warmup）、余弦衰减（Cosine Annealing）和梯度裁剪（Gradient Clipping）这三种在深度学习训练中非常实用的优化技巧。"}],"\n",["$","p","p-1",{"children":["首先，这三个技巧的核心目标是一致的：",["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"让模型在复杂的高维损失函数空间中，更稳定、更高效地找到一个好的解（局部最优解或全局最优解）"}],"。"]}],"\n",["$","p","p-2",{"children":"它们分别从不同角度解决了训练过程中可能遇到的问题："}],"\n",["$","ul","ul-0",{"children":["\n",["$","li","li-0",{"children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"学习率预热 (Warmup)"}],"：解决训练初期的不稳定性。"]}],"\n",["$","li","li-1",{"children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"余弦衰减 (Cosine Annealing)"}],"：解决训练中后期的精细调整和收敛问题。"]}],"\n",["$","li","li-2",{"children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"梯度裁剪 (Gradient Clipping)"}],"：解决训练过程中可能出现的梯度爆炸问题，充当“安全带”。"]}],"\n"]}],"\n",["$","p","p-3",{"children":"接下来我们逐一解析。"}],"\n",["$","h2","h2-0",{"id":"学习率预热-learning-rate-warmup","children":["$","a","a-0",{"href":"#学习率预热-learning-rate-warmup","node":{"type":"element","tagName":"a","properties":{"href":"#学习率预热-learning-rate-warmup"},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"学习率预热 (Learning Rate Warmup)","position":{"start":{"line":13,"column":4,"offset":363},"end":{"line":13,"column":32,"offset":391}}}]},"children":"学习率预热 (Learning Rate Warmup)"}]}],"\n",["$","h3","h3-0",{"id":"结论先行","children":["$","a","a-0",{"href":"#结论先行","node":{"type":"element","tagName":"a","properties":{"href":"#结论先行"},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"结论先行","position":{"start":{"line":15,"column":5,"offset":397},"end":{"line":15,"column":9,"offset":401}}}]},"children":"结论先行"}]}],"\n",["$","p","p-4",{"children":"在训练开始的几个周期（epoch）或迭代（step）内，将学习率（Learning Rate）从一个非常小的值（例如 0）线性或非线性地增加到预设的初始学习率。预热阶段结束后，再采用预设的学习率衰减策略（如余弦衰减）。"}],"\n",["$","$L8","img-0",{"src":"https://hedonspace.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/img/image-20250821155358300.png","style":{"zoom":"33%"},"node":{"type":"element","tagName":"img","properties":{"src":"https://hedonspace.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/img/image-20250821155358300.png","style":"zoom: 33%;"},"children":[],"position":{"start":{"line":19,"column":1,"offset":514},"end":{"line":19,"column":112,"offset":625}}}}],"\n",["$","h3","h3-1",{"id":"本质是什么","children":["$","a","a-0",{"href":"#本质是什么","node":{"type":"element","tagName":"a","properties":{"href":"#本质是什么"},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"本质是什么","position":{"start":{"line":21,"column":5,"offset":631},"end":{"line":21,"column":10,"offset":636}}}]},"children":"本质是什么"}]}],"\n",["$","p","p-5",{"children":"在训练之初，模型的权重是随机初始化的，可以说它对数据一无所知。如果此时直接用一个较大的学习率（Learning Rate），就好比让一个新手司机上来就踩满油门，结果很可能是车辆失控（模型参数被带到很差的空间），导致训练初期的剧烈震荡，甚至无法收敛。"}],"\n",["$","p","p-6",{"children":"学习率预热就是为了解决这个问题。它在训练开始的几个周期（epoch）或迭代（step）内，将学习率从一个非常小的值（甚至是 0）逐步提升到你预设的初始学习率。"}],"\n",["$","p","p-7",{"children":["它的本质是 ",["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"在模型尚未稳定时，通过控制更新步长来增加训练的稳定性"}],"。"]}],"\n",["$","p","p-8",{"children":"这是一种 \"先慢后快\" 的策略。它承认了模型在训练初期处于一个非常不稳定的状态，因此需要一个缓冲期。通过这个缓冲期，模型可以安全地度过最不稳定的阶段，为后续高效的训练打下坚实的基础。"}],"\n","$L9","\n","$La","\n","$Lb","\n","$Lc","\n","$Ld","\n","$Le","\n","$Lf","\n","$L10","\n","$L11","\n","$L12","\n","$L13","\n","$L14","\n","$L15","\n","$L16","\n","$L17","\n","$L18","\n","$L19","\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n","$L1a","\n","$L1b","\n","$L1c","\n","$L1d","\n","$L1e","\n","$L1f","\n","$L20","\n","$L21","\n","$L22","\n","$L23","\n","$L24","\n","$L25","\n","$L26","\n","$L27","\n","$L28","\n","$L29","\n","$L2a","\n","$L2b","\n","$L2c","\n","$L2d","\n","$L2e","\n","$L2f","\n","$L30","\n","$L31","\n","$L32","\n","$L33","\n","$L34","\n","$L35","\n","$L36","\n","$L37","\n","$L38","\n","$L39","\n","$L3a","\n","$L3b","\n","$L3c","\n","$L3d","\n","$L3e","\n","$L3f","\n","$L40","\n","$L41","\n","$L42","\n","$L43","\n","$L44","\n","$L45","\n","$L46","\n","$L47","\n","$L48","\n","$L49","\n","$L4a","\n","$L4b","\n","$L4c","\n","$L4d","\n","$L4e","\n","$L4f","\n","$L50","\n","$L51","\n","$L52","\n","$L53","\n","$L54","\n","$L55"]}]}],"$L56","$L57","$L58"]}],"$L59"]}]]}]}]
