41:["$","p","p-34",{"children":["为梯度的每一个元素设定一个区间的 ",["$","code","code-0",{"className":"$undefined","children":"[min_value, max_value]"}],"。然后遍历梯度向量中的每一个元素，如果某个元素的值小于 ",["$","code","code-1",{"className":"$undefined","children":"min_value"}],"，就把它设为 ",["$","code","code-2",{"className":"$undefined","children":"min_value"}],"；如果大于 ",["$","code","code-3",{"className":"$undefined","children":"max_value"}],"，就把它设为 ",["$","code","code-4",{"className":"$undefined","children":"max_value"}],"。"]}]
42:["$","p","p-35",{"children":["这种方法会 ",["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"改变梯度的方向"}],"。想象一个二维梯度向量 ",["$","code","code-0",{"className":"$undefined","children":"g = [10, 0.1]"}],"，如果设置裁剪区间为 ",["$","code","code-1",{"className":"$undefined","children":"[-1, 1]"}],"，裁剪后它会变成 ",["$","code","code-2",{"className":"$undefined","children":"g' = [1, 0.1]"}],"。原来的方向几乎是沿着 x 轴，但裁剪后的方向明显向 y 轴偏移了。这种方向上的改变可能会误导模型的更新。"]}]
